 mcq("Which is INCORRECT about political parties?", ["They contest elections.", "They shape public opinion.", "They are not needed in democracy.", "They form governments."], 'c', "Parties are essential."),
 mcq("Which Constitutional Amendment gave constitutional status to local government?", ["42nd", "73rd and 74th", "44th", "86th"], 'b', "73rd and 74th (1992)."),
 mcq("Gender division in India shows:", ["Equal wages for men and women", "Women constitute a small percentage of legislators", "No female literacy gap", "Equal sex ratio"], 'b', "Few women legislators."),
 sa("What is a coalition government? Give an example.", 2, "(1) Government formed by an alliance of several parties when no party gets majority. (1) E.g., NDA/UPA."),
